    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Creature\u2019s Journey is a story-rich tactical RPG featuring a hex grid battle system. Explore a vast map of foreign lands brimming with exotic creatures to discover, battle, and befriend. Plan your route over this uncharted world while heeding the biological adaptations of each team member. When dangers prove too perilous, will you retreat or push the boundaries of your journey and venture forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Creature's Journey is an independently-created video game by a small group of passionate creatives.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Creature\u2019s Journey is a story-rich tactical RPG featuring a hex grid battle system. Explore a vast map of foreign lands brimming with exotic creatures to discover, battle, and befriend. Plan your route over this uncharted world while heeding the biological adaptations of each team member. When dangers prove too perilous, will you retreat or push the boundaries of your journey and venture forward?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A Creature's Journey is an independently-created video game by a small group of passionate creatives.</p>",
    "short_description": "A peculiar creature finds themself alone with no memory of their past and a strong desire to find purpose for the future. After embarking on a journey to seek out answers with the aid of a mysterious traveler, hope turns to fear when an uncovered secret threatens the world.",
